<div class="flex transition-opacity duration-300"><span class="w-8 shrink-0 select-none pr-3 text-right text-fg-subtle">11</span><span class="whitespace-pre"><span class="tk-fn">&lt;/article</span>&gt;</span></div>
          </div>
          <div x-show="tab === 'agents'" x-cloak class="space-y-3 p-4 text-sm">
            <div class="ml-auto max-w-xs rounded-card bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-fg">Change the English title of "Introducing drafts" to "Introducing drafts, explained".</div>
            <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-control bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-fg-muted"><span class="text-primary">{{{ icon('check-circle-duotone', 'size-icon-md') }}}</span><span><span class="text-fg">read_records</span> article · search "drafts"</span></div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-control bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-fg-muted"><span class="text-primary">{{{ icon('check-circle-duotone', 'size-icon-md') }}}</span><span><span class="text-fg">update_record</span> article/1n1qci8qksoedxu98vv5 · title.en</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-fg">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-accent-text">{{{ icon('robot-duotone', 'size-icon-md') }}}</span>
              <p>Done. Only the English title changed, and only in the draft. Nothing goes live until it is published.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 font-mono text-xs text-fg">
              <span class="rounded-tag bg-surface px-2 py-1">article:read</span>
              <span class="rounded-tag bg-surface px-2 py-1">article:update</span>
              <span class="rounded-tag bg-surface px-2 py-1 text-fg-subtle">no delete</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="tint px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-fg-muted">
          <span x-show="tab === 'api'">No controller to write. Validation and unique checks included.</span>
          <span x-show="tab === 'admin'" x-cloak>Forms, language switch and publish, from the same model.</span>
          <span x-show="tab === 'site'" x-cloak>File-based routing. Reads only the live copy.</span>
          <span x-show="tab === 'agents'" x-cloak>Scoped, revocable, never more than the user can do.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
